   * TODO:
   * - Observe sampleCount intervals of the matching LIN frame.
   * - Fill gPeriodSampleCount/gPeriodAverageUs/gPeriodMinimumUs/gPeriodMaximumUs.
   * - Return BUS_BRIDGE_OK if each interval is within tolerance.
